<title>DENMARK: SBAB raises 4-pct 2003 bond to 500 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>SBAB raises 4-pct 2003 bond to 500 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish state-owned mortgage lender SBAB is raising the amount of its existing four percent bond due 2003 by 100 million crowns to 500 million Danish crowns, arranger Den Danske Bank said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>Den Danske Bank said it took all the bonds for resale.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969652</p>
